Critical Care\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExpertise for Middle-of-the-Night Emergencies and Advanced Specialty Care\nMedVet Mandeville offers the most comprehensive, state-of-the-art emergency and specialty veterinary care, serving as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care in New Orleans, including the Northshore and Covington areas. After a five-year hiatus, MedVet Mandeville is the first emergency animal hospital to offer\ncritical care\nservices in the southern Louisiana market.\nServing thousands of patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise to diagnose and treat your pet, giving the best chance for a positive outcome.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Mandeville Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nEmily Medici, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nMedical Director\nHeather Zamer, RVT\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nRita Akers\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nElisabeth Alost\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKenneth Arceneaux\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nShelby Bascle\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTwila Booke\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJenna Collins\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Veterinary Emergency & Critical Care\nCritical Care\nRachel C. Cuccia\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nCody Doyle\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nMarie Faucheux\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBeth Favaloro\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJulia Fincher\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLindsey Foto\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKristen Fulham\n, DVM, MS, DACVD®\nDermatology\nLindsey Harvey\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMallory Horridge\n, DVM, DACVECC\nCritical Care, Emergency Medicine\nMissy Jackson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNicholle Jenkins\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nDavid Kergosien\n, MS, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nElizabeth Kergosien\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nAriel Kilpatrick\n, DVM\nInternal Medicine\nPetra Koenig\n, BVM&S\nEmergency Medicine\nJordan Lee\n, DVM, Limited to the Practice of Surgery\nSurgery\nStephen Lemarie\n, DVM, MS, DACVD®\nDermatology\nJessica Lin Blache\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nSarah Lyles\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nBrittney McDonald\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKeegan McElroy\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlison Mikes\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKaitlyn Moss\n, VMD\nSurgery\nGarrett J. Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKayla Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nShannon Stroup\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nJensen Turbeville\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTrevor Upton\n, DVM\nSurgery\nKelli Urbina\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJorge Vilá\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nJill Yates\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n37\n)\nPet Stories\n“I cannot say enough positive things. My dog was in respiratory distress and they met me in the lobby, revived him; were so pleasant, communicative, calm and professional. This was a hospital caliber experience for pets. I knew I was in good hands with caring, supremely qualified professionals who were also kind.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAb